  "title": "Abraham B Probable NDE 3736",
  "date": "1978",
  "content": "I was lying down at a dentist office when he gave me a gauze to put me to sleep before surgery. Suddenly, I had to struggle to stay alive and breathe very strongly in order to stay alive. At one point within seconds, something inside me from my belly separated and departed at a great speed and went to a black tunnel. At the end, the part was engulf in an extremely bright white light. It was the most peaceful quiet and happy experience of my life. I was suddenly back after few seconds in my body like a vacuum. I heard the doctor speaking to me at all times of my experience. I never spoke to him about it and he never suspected I ever left my body.",
